δ n = 1 below n₀ (any two samplers are 1-close) and (1/2)^n from n₀ on, negligible
by negligible_two_pow_neg. At a generated index (expCollection_index; valid and of
width n by hV, G.valid, G.wellFormed) statClose_sampleBelowL on the sampler's n·n
coins (NUPPT.coinsEquivPoly), mapped through the decoder (expDec_expEnc), is moved to
the collection's domain through expCollection_domEquiv and expCollection_decD.

